<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche 9-mth sales rise 10 percent.</title>
<headline>Roche 9-mth sales rise 10 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>	     (In millions of Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Pharmaceuticals		7,638	     vs   6,810</p>
<p> Vitamins &amp; fine chemicals  2,448	     vs   2,268</p>
<p> Diagnostics,excluding *RBL   540	     vs     464</p>
<p> Fragrances &amp; flavours	1,098	     vs   1,130</p>
<p> Other				  5	     vs	38</p>
<p> Sales (excluding RBL)     11,729	     vs  10,710</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Swiss pharmaceuticals group is Roche Holding AG.</p>
<p>RBL, Roche Biomedical Laboratories, has not been consolidated since May, 1995. Its sales for the period January-April 1995 were 296 million francs. -- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
